libpqxx-vh (8.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package libpqxx 8.0.2 (tag 8.0.2, commit 92e7d64a3ee9) as a precompiled
    static SDK for ubuntu-24.04-amd64, built with upstream CMake + Ninja from
    the official release archive.
    - g++ 14, C++20, -O3, PIC, generic x86-64, hardening flags, no LTO, no
      patches.
    - Upstream's test suite runs against a throwaway PostgreSQL before
      packaging.
  * New development-only package libpqxx-vh-dev: the SDK below
    /usr/lib/<multiarch>/libpqxx-vh and pkg-config metadata libpqxx-vh. No
    runtime package; coexists with Ubuntu's libpqxx-dev.
  * pkg-config links the packaged libpqxx.a by path and libpq by SONAME
    (-l:libpq.so.5), so Meson static dependencies never bundle libpq.
  * Versions are UPSTREAM-REVISION (vl-release debian-upstream policy):
    8.0.2-1.

 -- Cooper Larson <cooper@valkyrianlabs.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:28:07 +0000
